{"text": "La liebre saltaba por el campo y presumía de sus largas patas. Al ver caminar a la tortuga, se rio de su lentitud. La tortuga le recordó que cada animal se mueve de una manera distinta. Tortuga: Ir despacio no significa que no pueda llegar.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.301083, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.315833, "end": 0.670291, "from": 3, "to": 9}, {"start": 0.685041, "end": 1.275791, "from": 10, "to": 17}, {"start": 1.290541, "end": 1.497291, "from": 18, "to": 21}, {"start": 1.512083, "end": 1.630249, "from": 22, "to": 24}, {"start": 1.645, "end": 2.029, "from": 25, "to": 30}, {"start": 2.04375, "end": 2.102833, "from": 31, "to": 32}, {"start": 2.117583, "end": 2.708333, "from": 33, "to": 41}, {"start": 2.723083, "end": 2.855999, "from": 42, "to": 44}, {"start": 2.87075, "end": 3.136583, "from": 45, "to": 48}, {"start": 3.151375, "end": 3.594416, "from": 49, "to": 55}, {"start": 3.609208, "end": 4.214708, "from": 56, "to": 61}, {"start": 5.242791, "end": 5.493874, "from": 63, "to": 65}, {"start": 5.508625, "end": 5.715375, "from": 66, "to": 69}, {"start": 5.730166, "end": 6.232291, "from": 70, "to": 77}, {"start": 6.247041, "end": 6.2913319, "from": 78, "to": 79}, {"start": 6.306125, "end": 6.439041, "from": 80, "to": 82}, {"start": 6.453791, "end": 7.103582, "from": 83, "to": 90}, {"start": 7.4285, "end": 7.6205, "from": 92, "to": 94}, {"start": 7.635291, "end": 7.989749, "from": 95, "to": 98}, {"start": 8.0045, "end": 8.122666, "from": 99, "to": 101}, {"start": 8.137416, "end": 8.299874, "from": 102, "to": 104}, {"start": 8.314625, "end": 9.038291, "from": 105, "to": 113}, {"start": 10.057291, "end": 10.249291, "from": 115, "to": 117}, {"start": 10.264041, "end": 10.780916, "from": 118, "to": 125}, {"start": 10.795708, "end": 10.928624, "from": 126, "to": 128}, {"start": 10.943416, "end": 11.489832, "from": 129, "to": 136}, {"start": 11.504625, "end": 11.667083, "from": 137, "to": 140}, {"start": 11.681833, "end": 11.991958, "from": 14